Z||000018||California_Gold||08-15-2001||06:35 PM||||To all those "disbelievers" out there...<P>There is a body kit available for the Fiero that gives it a "ricy" look, just hard to find.  Actually it is made for those damn Probes, IMSA body kit!.  The thing will fit with minimal modifying, project currently in progress on a 85 SE powered by a Honda four (turbo, intercooler, everything).  Anyone would like rough sketches of a finished piece, e-mail me and i'll see what i can do.  Anyway, with the Honda motor...<BR>0-60 in 5.8 <BR>0-100 in 11.3<BR>top speed- 157.76<BR>top speed w/ nitrous- 166.9<P>My secret is closely guarded as to how I did it (day and a half to install).  ||||reg||2
